    "evidence": "Started from the final anti-anchored source-review packet only; did not consult earlier verdicts, canonical audit contents, mathematical-review receipts or proposed repair overlays before deciding. Independently read arXiv:2609.06906v1 Algorithm 3.1 (lines 282-306), Algorithm D.2 and Lemma D.3 (2138-2164), and Lemma D.4 (2169-2186), plus the complete current CountedPhaseProgram module, its authored lessons and assumption differences. Fresh LEAN_NUM_THREADS=2 lake env lean production and Tests/SmoothedPicardHMCCountedPhaseProgram.lean both exit 0 on Lean 4.33.0; theorem axioms are precisely propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound. Verified canonical packet hash, source/statement/reconstruction hashes, and equality of the complete packet module with current normalized UTF-8 file bytes (module SHA256 6a65034723b373b5e7f73a2ac06baf1b57b3b77394f117dbff4f95bbcc79fbb5). No code changes. Publication/source attribution is honest for the declared scoped component, with exact assumption differences retained; the broader paper result is not certified by this review. Publication binding SHA256 13ee4921ffb90c44eece7c45a714a3ed562af4bdc8baa03f7fa5133bb34d537c.",
